			<TRAN tranid="obaci_acct_263r" trcode="obaci_acct_263r" compress="1" encryption="1" inputcheck="1" useattr="0" />
		</TRID_INFO>
		<TRIO_INFO>
			<TRAN name="obaci_acct_262a" title="계좌_CFD계약 승인서명 처리" realdata="0" dessvr="9" >
				<TRBLOCK name="InBlock1" inout="in" _len="258" _ulen="190" >

ACNO^계좌번호^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
ASNO^계좌일련번호^2^0^0^0^0^0^0
