			</TRAN>
			<TRAN name="obaci_acct_263r" title="계좌_CFD계약 승인서명 내역" realdata="0" dessvr="9" >
				<TRBLOCK name="InBlock1" inout="in" _len="122" _ulen="90" >

ACNO^계좌번호^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
ASNO^계좌일련번호^2^0^0^0^0^0^0
ACNT_PWD^계좌비밀번호^68^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
				<TRBLOCK name="OutBlock1" inout="out" _len="80" _ulen="64" >

AGRM_DATE^동의일자^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
